feat: strict live and test environment isolation and UI cleanup

- UI Cleanup: TestModeBanner returns null in live mode (completely hidden)
- Header: mode indicator pill hidden in live mode; only shown in test mode
- Sidebar: mode badges hidden in live mode; only TEST badge in test mode
- Settings: shows Operating Environment as Live Production Mode with Switch to Test Mode
- Switching: hard redirect flushes all client caches and synchronizes UI
- Scoped Queries: dashboard, quotations, invoices, customers, reports all scoped to active environment
- API Endpoints: /api/quotations, /api/invoices, /api/customers, /api/notifications, /api/export scoped to active environment
- Cross-Environment Guards: quotation and invoice detail pages and API endpoints return 404 on mismatched environment
- Document Builders: new quote and invoice pages scope customer dropdowns to active environment
- Customer Portal: token-based quotation view scopes multi-quote listing to match active quote environment
- DB Migration: added environment columns with check constraint and RLS isolation policies
- QA: automated test suite verifying all 18 isolation rules passes with 0 failures
